  "intro": {
    "title": "She, it or they?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lowercase sie means she, it (for die-nouns) or they. The verb tells you which: sie ist (she/it is) vs sie sind (they are). Capital Sie is the formal 'you', with its own lesson."
    ]
  },
